<body>
<main>
<article>
<h1>Account created</h1>
<p>Your account <strong><%= it.email %></strong> has been registered successfully.</p>
<p>You will be redirected to the sign-in page shortly. <a href="/">Continue now</a>.</p>
</article>
</main>
</body>
</html>
